					"content": "Almond Tofu? But I still have to take the medicine first...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220080404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hongdou"
				},
				{
					"id": 220080404,
					"content": "Doudou, be a good girl, you'll only get better if you take your medicine... Aaaaand, there's Almond Tofu waiting for you...",
